{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062751/block/singleImage/3261755/df/01M6Z6MD7GB11ZRN2XW2B739A5.jpg?updatedAt=1794196118\"/><figcaption>青山公路荃灣段發生車禍。（fb「香港公共交通智庫」圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>荃灣發生車禍。 今日（9日）上午約11時，一輛客貨車沿青山公路—荃灣段行駛，駛至力生廣場對開時，與一輛巴士相撞，客貨車翻側掃毀巴士站，巴士站損毀嚴重，司機自行爬出車外待救。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，輕傷由救護車送院治理。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.540997+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T03:48:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.485798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:44.554632+00:00","content_hash":"9e8ed4287fffcaaa25af2dd63fe1e083e7af5cb34901bb5640a3700f151739cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.540997+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}